  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed development, because of its position, size, scale and appearance, would constitute a bulky and obtrusive feature that would harm the appearance and character of the surrounding gardens and the Conservation Area as a whole and result in a poor and overbearing outlook for neighbours, harmful to their living conditions. Furthermore inadequate details are provided with regard the access onto The Avenue. The proposal therefore fails to meet adopted Unitary Development Plan Policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development), ENV.B.2.2 (Conservation Areas) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) and T.4.4 (Road Safety), and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines."
